<p>London Dec 116.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat Ipswich Spot 99.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Feb 98.00 Mar 99.00 Apr/Jun 102.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Jan 99.50/99.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Jan 99.00 Jan/Mar 100.00 Apr/Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan 99.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Shropshire/Cheshire Jan 97.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan 99.50</p>
<p>Avon Jan 99.00 Feb 100.00 Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
</text>
